# ARGUS – Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and set your backend URL:

```
NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8000
```

**For Vercel deployment:**
Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL` in Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables, pointing to your public backend URL (e.g., via ngrok: `https://xxxx.ngrok-free.app`).
